Analyze-gate fixes from the first Codemagic run:
- login: TextField has no validator param -> TextFormField; string
  interpolation lint
- home: monthPct! (public final field does not promote); two
  'const EdgeInsets.only(right: i == 0 ? ...)' with a non-const loop
  var (invalid constant)
- widgets: Border.fromSide does not exist -> Border.all;
  Color.transparent does not exist -> Colors.transparent;
  Animation has no dispose() -> type the CurvedAnimation as CurvedAnimation
- leaves/punch: missing provider import for context.watch
- more/main/widgets: const + conditional-assignment lint cleanups

Also aligns the remaining hr.flavorflow.co.in references (api default,
pubspec description, ARCHITECTURE.md, theme doc) with the live domain
gdfoods.duckdns.org (commit d686890) so a plain local flutter run hits
the live API.
